Modified for Sklubot (2026-11-22): the three methods were merged into one short skill (hypothesis with confidence, one question at a time with a recommended answer, at most five, restatement with 'what we will not do', a real yes, answers kept in a note); tool names replaced by Sklubot's (ask_user, memory_search, conversation_search, file_save); code-repository, sub-agent and spec-file steps removed; rule added that it is never used in an unattended turn; translated into French (SKILL.fr.md).
Only text is included; no script, picture or other file of the original folders is bundled. Names of other products are not used as titles.
